  "releaseNotes": "Add native memory budgets and admission, prepared pools and arenas, typed layouts, shared and weak ownership, owner diagnostics and ownership code fixes. Speed up hot paths with direct lease spans, static span processors, NativePool<T>.Shared, NativeTransfer<T>.Create and uninitialized acquisitions. NativeTransfer<T> is now a value type, so rebuild consumers. Per-event accounting counters are now opt-in.",
